AREA OF TRAPEZOID $AXYD$

Lastly, we need to determine the area of trapezoid $AXYD.$ Note that $$\angle XAD=\angle YDA = \frac{1}{2}(60^\circ)=30^\circ.$$Drop perpendiculars from $X$ and $Y$ to $G$ and $H,$ respectively, on $AD.$ [asy]
